      "title": "Brijlaxmi Leasing and Finance Limited Announces Company Secretary and Compliance Officer Changes, Effective February 14, 2026",
      "body": "Brijlaxmi Leasing and Finance Limited announced that Ms. Anchal Patwari resigned from the post of Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of the Company due to her personal reasons, namely career improvement and growth opportunities, with effect from close of business hours on February 14, 2026. The company approved the appointment of Ms. Hiral Patel as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of the Company with effect from February 14, 2026. Ms. Hiral Patel has experience in Corporate Secretarial and Compliance functions. She is an Associate Member of Institute of Company Secretaries (ICSI) and a Commerce Graduate. Her ICSI membership number is A75088.",
